chx:CQ2 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which values may be keys, why must they be hashable, and which behaviours of the chapter's text differ in current Python (insertion order, the unhashable message, merge operators)?"@en .
